<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix C On the need for a new paradigm for reward modeling ‣ Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The theoretical Argument.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Reward-KL Pareto Frontier</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Experimental Runs Hyper-parameter Sweeps</span></a></li>
