<div id="p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:173%;">Supplementary Material: 
<br class="ltx_break">Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment</span></p>
</div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Preliminaries and Notation</h2>

<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Preliminaries.</h4>

<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the supplementary material we provide the following information:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Theoretical Results and Proofs ‣ Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">App.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a> provides the proofs for all theoretical results presented in the paper.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A3" title="Appendix C On the need for a new paradigm for reward modeling ‣ Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">App.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> discusses the limitations of the Bradley-Terry (BT) reward-modeling paradigm and provides a path to improve reward hacking with a new approach for reward modeling that accounts for preference residuals.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Reward-KL Pareto Frontier ‣ Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">App.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a> presents additional empirical results that validate the convergence of the estimated Reward-KL Pareto frontier.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A5" title="Appendix E Experimental Runs Hyper-parameter Sweeps ‣ Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">App.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a> provides the full details for the extensive hyper-parameter sweeps performed for the GRPO and PPO baseline experiments.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A6" title="Appendix F Licenses of Used Assets ‣ Theoretical Limits of Language Model Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">App.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">F</span></a> details the licenses for all public datasets, model checkpoints, and software libraries utilized in our evaluation.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Notation Table.</h4>

